-mobility and energy storage, and other industries. The company also provides coal based, gas-based, nuclear, and hydro power plants, as well as solar power systems; rail, transportation and transmission systems; defense and aerospace products; industrial systems; and battery energy storage system and e-mobility solutions. In addition, it offers steam generators and steam generator auxiliaries, soot blowers, valves, piping systems, seamless steel tubes, valves, pressurized fluidized bed gasifiers, steam and gas turbines, turbo generators, industrial sets, castings and forgings, condenser and heat exchangers, pumps, Hydro Power Plants, compressors, and automation and control systems. Further, the company provides software system solutions, medium voltage vacuum switchgears, on load tap changers, LT switchgears and bus ducts, transformers and reactors, capacitors, bushings, control gears, insulators and ceramics, and electrical machines. It also provides rail transportation systems and equipment, defence and aerospace, oil field equipment, and fabricated equipment and mechanical packages. The company has a strategic collaboration with E2S Company Limited for the development of excitation systems for synchronous machines. The company was incorporated in 1964 and is based in New Delhi, India.","beta":0.896,"sharesOutstanding":3482063355,"marketCap":1519224225792,"trailingPE":52.7569,"forwardPE":27.0373,"priceToBook":5.6731,"enterpriseToEbitda":44.494,"dividendYield":0.32,"heldPercentInsiders":0.6006,"heldPercentInstitutions":0.2258,"earningsGrowth":1.185,"revenueGrowth":0.238,"website":"https://www.bhel.com","fullTimeEmployees":39784,"recommendationKey":"hold","targetMeanPrice":436.7895,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"financialCurrency":"INR"},"estimates":{"eps":{"0q":{"avg":2.1714,"low":2.1714,"high":2.1714,"yearAgoEps":1.1,"numberOfAnalysts":1.0,"growth":0.974,"currency":"INR","methodology":"normalized"},"+1q":{"avg":4.3428,"low":4.3428,"high":4.3428,"yearAgoEps":3.68,"